{"title": "Delhi Flooded by Heavy Rain, Traffic Disrupted Amid Red Alert", "summary": "Heavy rainfall caused significant waterlogging and traffic disruptions across parts of Delhi. The India Meteorological Department (IMD) issued a red alert for the city. The deluge led to submerged roads and snared vehicular movement, impacting daily commutes.", "summary_points": ["Heavy rain caused widespread waterlogging in Delhi.", "Traffic across the city was significantly disrupted.", "The India Meteorological Department (IMD) issued a red alert.", "Submerged roads contributed to the traffic snarls."], "title_hi": "भारी बारिश से दिल्ली डूबी, रेड अलर्ट के बीच यातायात बाधित", "summary_hi": "भारी बारिश के कारण दिल्ली के कई हिस्सों में गंभीर जलभराव और यातायात व्यवधान उत्पन्न हुआ। भारत मौसम विज्ञान विभाग (IMD) ने शहर के लिए रेड अलर्ट जारी किया। मूसलाधार बारिश से सड़कें डूब गईं और वाहनों की आवाजाही बाधित हुई, जिससे दैनिक आवागमन प्रभावित हुआ।", "summary_points_hi": ["भारी बारिश के कारण दिल्ली में व्यापक जलभराव हुआ।", "पूरे शहर में यातायात बुरी तरह प्रभावित हुआ।", "भारत मौसम विज्ञान विभाग (IMD) ने रेड अलर्ट जारी किया।", "जलमग्न सड़कों के कारण यातायात जाम की स्थिति बनी।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning coverage focused on the impact of the heavy rain on the city, highlighting the waterlogging and traffic jams as direct consequences of the downpour. The red alert issued by the IMD was presented as a significant warning of the severe weather conditions.", "center": "Centrist coverage foregrounded the immediate effects of the heavy rainfall on Delhi, emphasizing the waterlogging and traffic disruptions. The issuance of a red alert by the IMD was noted as a key development in response to the severe weather."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "वाम-झुकाव वाली कवरेज ने शहर पर भारी बारिश के प्रभाव पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया, जलभराव और यातायात जाम को मूसलाधार बारिश के प्रत्यक्ष परिणाम के रूप में उजागर किया। IMD द्वारा जारी रेड अलर्ट को गंभीर मौसम की स्थिति की एक महत्वपूर्ण चेतावनी के रूप में प्रस्तुत किया गया।", "center": "मध्यम-झुकाव वाली कवरेज ने दिल्ली पर भारी बारिश के तत्काल प्रभावों को प्रमुखता से दिखाया, जिसमें जलभराव और यातायात व्यवधानों पर जोर दिया गया। IMD द्वारा रेड अलर्ट जारी करना गंभीर मौसम की प्रतिक्रिया में एक महत्वपूर्ण विकास के रूप में नोट किया गया।"}, "topic": "Environment", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://www.livemint.com/lm-img/img/2026/07/30/1600x900/logo/A-cyclist-wades-through-a-waterlogged-road-during-_1785413799616_1785413805670_4ee8400c-9612-424b-a367-4fcbd728e222.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "National Herald", "owner": "National Herald", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Heavy rain floods parts of Delhi, snarls traffic as IMD issues red alert"}, {"source": "Mathrubhumi English", "owner": "Mathrubhumi English", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Delhi drowns in rain: Waterlogging, traffic jams hit city as IMD issues red alert"}, {"source": "The Pioneer", "owner": "The Pioneer", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPNTVIMkhwdmpqc29FNDQ1RzBLMVpOTGFTWWRQVU1CcmdSaTdSb2hpZXctUjZWS1ZhbFJxVFF0N1dhX0tZS1VFNHU2eXVTYlBYSEVRMnlkM0h6RjNjMWMxekU5TlhmSHFGODN0MHo4RlYyaVpPNG9pZFhqVDh0NVhRUi1BaUtCN0FvZldYRDUwYnRqcWIteGhqREtlcGg?oc=5", "headline": "Delhi Rains Trigger 136 Waterlogging, Tree Fall and Power Outage Complaints"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/monsoon-weather-are-schools-open-or-closed-tomorrow-in-india-imd-predicts-heavy-rainfall-in-states-latest-news-rain-11785409631152.html", "headline": "Monsoon weather: Are schools open or closed tomorrow in India as IMD predicts heavy rainfall in various states?"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/imd-heavy-rainfall-alert-flash-flood-risk-india-11785408511738.html", "headline